WEBVTT

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:06.292
We’ll begin with CSV-style external data and then separate features from the target.

00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:14.047
Next, we create training and testing sets, fit a simple classifier, measure performance,

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:19.491
compare the model with a baseline, make a new prediction, and discuss leakage.

00:00:20.126 --> 00:00:24.829
The final example puts the main stages together in one compact workflow.
